  "problem": "From left to right, what are the missing numbers in the following sentence?\n\nA lemonade recipe requires $\\frac{2}{7}$ cups of lemon juice for every cup of water. Therefore, the lemonade has a ratio of $\\boxed{}$ cups of lemon juice to $\\boxed{}$ cups of water.",
